   },
   "text": "fenceless minority of its people. There is also the other fact that whenever the rights of one man are destroyed the rights of all men are impaired. Every time justice has been perverted to wreak popular prejudice on a colored man the whole system of justice has been weakened for everybody. Organized society will not stand such strains. What the South is really doing is to create a kind of anarchy certain to react upon its creators. You cannot deliberately foster ignorance and lawlessness without paying the price.",
